sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gatekeeper
    participant PaymentTypeSelector
    participant EntitiesAPI
    participant CurrencyAccount
    participant FXService
    participant PayoutsEngine

    Client->>Gatekeeper: POST /credit-transfer
    Note over Client,Gatekeeper: Request contains dictionaries:<br/>- Sender<br/>- Recipient<br/>- Client<br/>- Sub Entity<br/>- etc.

    Gatekeeper->>PaymentTypeSelector: Determine payment type
    PaymentTypeSelector-->>Gatekeeper: PTB | PTC | Internal Transfer

    alt Sub-entity payout
        Gatekeeper->>EntitiesAPI: Get entity
        EntitiesAPI-->>Gatekeeper: Entity details
        
        Gatekeeper->>CurrencyAccount: Get currency account
        CurrencyAccount-->>Gatekeeper: Account information
        
        Gatekeeper->>FXService: Perform FX validation
        FXService-->>Gatekeeper: Validation result
        
        Gatekeeper->>EntitiesAPI: Get sub-entity
        EntitiesAPI-->>Gatekeeper: Sub-entity details
        
        Gatekeeper->>PayoutsEngine: API call
        PayoutsEngine-->>Gatekeeper: Response
        
    else PayoutType is PTB
        Gatekeeper->>EntitiesAPI: Get entity
        EntitiesAPI-->>Gatekeeper: Entity details
        
        Gatekeeper->>CurrencyAccount: Get currency account information
        CurrencyAccount-->>Gatekeeper: Account details
        
        Note over Gatekeeper: Check PayoutType.InternalTransfer<br/>(PTB or CS related?)
        
        alt PayoutContext.Category == "integrated_platform"
            Note over Gatekeeper: Validate payout route exists<br/>What is this category?
        end
        
        Gatekeeper->>FXService: Perform FX trade
        Note over FXService: Validating trade capability<br/>or actually executing trade?
        FXService-->>Gatekeeper: Trade result
        
        alt Client settlements
            Note over Gatekeeper: Validate payment_instrument_id<br/>exists on recipient dictionary
        end
        
        Gatekeeper->>PayoutsEngine: API call
        PayoutsEngine-->>Gatekeeper: Response
    end

    Gatekeeper-->>Client: Response
